OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Channel Islands Co-op said the
OL,7,Fnew triangular route, between Guernsey,
OL,8,FCherbourg and Portsmouth, created
OL,9,F"additional cost and reduced
OL,10,Fresilience".
